      "message": "Andrea, for context, the process for this is [documented here](http://go/cros-fingerprint-firmware-branching-and-signing#current-status).\n\nWhen reviewing, I usually [check out the branch for the CL](https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/Documentation/user-review-ui.html#download) locally and then diff it against the commit from which it was merged. If everything is correct, there should be no differences (since we do a pure merge into the release branch), except for `OWNERS` files: https://crrev.com/c/3441166.\n\nFor example, for this CL I did:\n\n```\ngit diff 4a6781cb21..a30940ac8d47cc113cef9e324117d60008486bfb --stat\n```",
